chezmoi dots help — Show command help

USAGE
  chezmoi dots help [<command> [<subcommand>]]

ARGUMENTS
  command  Help page (default: root index). Only pkg (status, bump, add) and secrets (run) have subcommands.
  Internal live help is available explicitly but omitted from the root index.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  None.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots help
  chezmoi dots help view
  chezmoi dots help pkg status
  chezmoi dots help live
